"0"><formatted-text><run fontsize="18" bold="true">Appeals Friction Radar</run><run fontsize="9">
Pathway Appeals Services (fictional) · 3,966 appeals · 1 January to 30 September 2026. Turnaround averages 14.9 days and only 49.6% of appeals meet SLA. Urgent appeals carry a 7-day target and take 15.5 days — slower than the Standard queue they are supposed to jump.</run></formatted-text></zone><zone h="23500" id="4" name="Where the days actually go" w="100000" x="0" y="6000" /><zone h="23500" id="5" name="Turnaround against the target, by appeal type" w="100000" x="0" y="29500" /><zone h="23500" id="6" name="Friction bands behave the way the score says they should" w="100000" x="0" y="53000" /><zone h="23500" id="7" name="The cost of an incomplete intake" w="100000" x="0" y="76500" /></zone></zone></zones></dashboard></dashboards></workbook>